  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to our bodacious beach house where modern decor meets blissful beachy vibes. Our home is just a short jaunt from Gulf Place including restaurants such as Shunk Gulley and Perfect Pig and is ideal for a multifamily vacation.<br><br>THE HOUSE <br>We’ve thought of everything so you don’t have to! This new well appointed home easily accommodates multiple families (16 guests) with 7 bedrooms consisting of 6 king suites and 1 twin bunk room (4 beds) as well as common living spaces and balconies on each of its 3 levels. Relax in the optionally heated private pool or hop in the complimentary 6 seat street legal golf cart and find yourself on one the best white sand beaches in the world within minutes.<br><br>Amenities such as 6 brand new YOLO beach cruiser bikes, 12 Tommy Bahama beach chairs, 10 ft beach canopy, beach toys, corn hole boards, board games, and smart TVs throughout will ensure a fun filled 5 star stay!<br><br>Equipped with stainless steel high end kitchen appliances, 2 Keurig coffee makers (pot & K-cups), beverage fridge, gas grill, 2 separate washers/dryers, 1GB WiFi, and cable TV, Rad Time Off provides all the comforts of home.<br><br>Our home is also very family friendly. We are happy to provide a high chair, 2 booster seats, a mini crib, a pack-n-play, and 2 baby gates.<br><br><br>ABOUT THE AREA <br>Our home is near Gulf Place perfectly situated between Blue Mountain Beach and Dune Allen Beach. You will be minutes from a plethora of restaurants including Shunk Gulley, Perfect Pig, Papa Surf Burger Bar, Goatfeathers, Vue on 30a, and Stinky’s Fish Camp just to name a few. Satisfy your sweet tooth with ice cream at Pecan Jacks, Ice Cream Shoppe, or Blue Mountain Creamery after dinner! Grocery options include Publix (less than 2 miles) and Walmart (less than 5 miles) for those times you’d rather eat in.<br><br><br>BEACH ACCESS<br>Nearest access is Ed Walline Regional Beach Access which has parking, bathroom facilities, and lifeguards. Additional beach access points include Gulfview Heights Regional Beach Access, Spooky Lane (no parking), Fort Panic Regional Beach Access, and Dune Allen Regional Beach Access.<br><br><br>ACCOMMODATIONS:<br>Bedroom 1 - King bed/ ensuite bathroom (1st<br>Floor)<br>Bedroom 2 - Twin over Twin bunk room - 4 beds (1st Floor)/ access to full bathroom<br>Bedroom 3 - King bed/ ensuite bathroom (2nd Floor)<br>Bedroom 4 - King bed/ ensuite bathroom (2nd Floor)<br>Bedroom 5 - King bed/ ensuite bathroom (3rd Floor)<br>Bedroom 6 - King bed/ ensuite bathroom (3rd Floor)<br>Bedroom 7 - King bed/ ensuite bathroom (3rd Floor)<br><br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>* 6 King Suites<br>* Bunk room (2 bunks = 4 twin beds)<br>* Private Pool with Heat Option (extra fee)<br>* Pool chase lounge chairs (6)<br>* 3 Private Balconies, 1 including dining table<br>* 6-Seater Street Legal Golf Cart<br>* 6 YOLO beach cruiser bikes and locks<br>* Beach chairs (12)<br>* 10 ft beach canopy<br>* Assorted Beach toys<br>* Backpack cooler<br>* Beach towels <br>* Corn Hole<br>* Built in gas grill<br>* Fully stocked kitchen<br>* Coffeemakers (2), Keurig pot & K-cup option<br>* 6 burner Viking gas range<br>* Extra large fridge/freezer with filtered water dispenser <br>* Beverage refrigerator (1st floor near pool)<br>* Washers/Dryers (1st & 3rd floors)<br>* Irons/handheld steamers & ironing boards<br>* High speed Internet (1GB)<br>* Smart TVs in all bedrooms and living rooms<br>* Cable TV in living rooms (1st & 2nd floor)<br>* Board games & card games<br>* Dishwasher pods<br>* Laundry pods<br>* Trash bags<br>* Starter pack of soap, shampoo, conditioner, lotion, makeup remover towelettes, toilet paper, and paper towels<br>* Linens provided (bedding, bath towels, wash cloths, makeup remover cloths)<br>* Hair dryers in each bathroom <br>* Luggage holders in each bedroom <br>* Tankless water heaters for endless hot water<br>* Mini crib and pack-n-play<br>* Baby gates (2)<br>* High chair and 2 booster seats<br>* Sound machines in each bedroom<br>* Ceiling fans in each bedroom<br>* Extra portable fans <br>* Extra blankets and pillows <br>* Driveway parking for 3 vehicles<br><br><br>We offer contactless entry. You will receive a unique door code to use for the length of your stay prior to check-in.<br><br>Garage access via Homelink button on the included golf cart.<br><br><br>Option to heat the pool October through April for $50/day. Must be requested at least 1 week prior to arrival.<br>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
